      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "LEASED -> RELEASING also happens when provisioning fails or is cancelled (teardown is the compensation).\nIllegal: ACTIVE -> FREE, QUARANTINE -> LEASED, any jump that skips a state. CHECK constraints + unit tests enforce it.",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 171773443,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
